---
import Csv from "./Csv.astro";
import GenerateLink from "./GenerateLink.astro";
---

<div class="section-card w-full p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:gap-4">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
    <span class="eyebrow">Portability</span>
    <h2 class="display-title text-2xl text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">🔗 Backup & Share</h2>
    <p class="section-copy text-sm sm:text-base">Export a local backup or generate a shareable link.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="section-copy text-sm sm:text-base">Remember to back up your data regularly using the CSV export to avoid losing your progress.</p>
  <p class="section-copy text-sm sm:text-base">To view all your data, <a href="/data" class="page-link font-semibold">open the data view</a>.</p>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 justify-start">
    <Csv />
    <GenerateLink />
  </div>
</div>